ation approval.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"old_source_cards_preserved\": 21,\n+  \"proposed_source_cards\": 22,\n+  \"real_declaration_bound_highlights\": 3,\n+  \"selected_VALUE_occurrences_verified\": {\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlineBregman.quadratic_geometry\": [\n+      \"hasStrictFDerivAt_norm_sq\",\n+      \"HasGradientAt.fderiv_apply\",\n+      \"norm_sub_sq_real\"\n+    ],\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.euclidean_variable_regret\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineBregman.quadratic_geometry\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineConvex.sourceProper_of_domain\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.iterate_eq_of_source_updates\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.source_variable_regret\"\n+    ],\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.euclidean_fixed_regret\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineBregman.quadratic_geometry\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineConvex.sourceProper_of_domain\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.iterate_eq_of_source_updates\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.source_fixed_regret\"\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"findings\": [\n+    \"Exact current prehashes match; named append replay and reverse-tail removal preserve every prior parsed object including chapter completion history,21cards and all highlights.\",\n+    \"One source card coherently covers shared geometry and both signed bounds. Three existing-schema full_name highlights avoid a synthetic declaration. Geometry prose only describes actual derivative/divergence; endpoint prose separately identifies canonical Option run and every feasible comparator.\",\n+    \"Variable T>0, used positive nonincreasing steps, max0..T-1, eta(T-1), half factors, new-state scoring, fixedT0 and negative squared movement match frozen accepted core. Full EReal no-bottom/domain/global-support and explicit attained minima remain; no affine/Lipschitz/bounded-domain restriction added.\",\n+    \"Atomic binder classification accounts separately for typing, ambient structure and source premises; hmin membership and minimum conjuncts explicit. No EXCESS premise detected.\",\n+    \"All selected proof parents occur in actual compiled VALUE sets. No necessity/transitive-graph/import-as-proof inference; source topology, declaration graph, compressed lesson and conceptual transport kept distinct.\",\n+    \"Valid generator status compiled. Stable local/unmerged/unpublished wording does not assert canary/package success or stale pending core BODY. Source optimality gap and mandatory fixed exercise retained; B4 remains open.\",\n+    \"Seven forward containers and six future claims unchanged; no prescient-container closure from branch03 alone; C2partial/null and GoalACTIVE retained.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"conditions\": [\n+    \"Tests root import only after separate complete canary BODY acceptance; no Test candidate read here.\",\n+    \"Before application recheck exact prehashes and produce exact reviewed AFTER snapshots using specified serialization.\",\n+    \"Shared root/Tests/full harness/contributor/site/registry/personal pixels and FINAL remain required; no acceptance of those gates from proposal review.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"tmp\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-integration-proposal-20261011\\\\proposal-v2.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"2e8cbc6a7e24f0f8fe6e7547ee26b43037a918e609b8cf617f5fc66852af4561\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"tmp\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-integration-proposal-20261011\\\\plan-v2.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"bdc23a493588e942f5cd4e9745ec6c333193e3eddc96684757adaf7b17d55e9b\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"website/content/chapters.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"74792b4767d6669e867c9034fc8eb09949360f1a1aaadcdd048ef92cb64eca81\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"website/content/readings.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"cd71475748324e9cab13ff3c0c08cd980a099e7c6ad77431185a367d2fcedde8\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"website/content/highlights.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"1c8c3697a21f24c416848938aaf54fdf9cc55