 continuous closed sublevels on univ and SourceProper from no-bottom/domain. Exact algebra rewrites supplied attained quadratic minima into shared Bregman objective. iterate_eq_of_source_updates proves SAME actual Option run; source_variable_regret gives full EReal new-state score, previous-state max, last used eta and negative movement squares.\",\n+    \"fixed\": \"Same actual-run identification and source_fixed_regret, with exact finite-sum scalar normalization. No positive-horizon premise, so T0 retained. No affine/Lipschitz loss restriction or assumed regret/conclusion.\",\n+    \"attainment\": \"hmin remains explicit feasible attained-update premise. No unconditional existence, global total selector or recovery after None. Finite feasible losses make toReal scoring faithful.\",\n+    \"source_gap\": \"Implementation uses accepted generic proximal/source endpoints and selector identification. It does not certify the literal author constrained-support existence step; SRC-OPTIMALITY remains unresolved source-proof justification. Fixed exercise remains a printed gap whose bound is supplied by reused accepted fixed endpoint, not omitted.\"\n+  },\n+  \"compiled_evidence\": {\n+    \"focused_v3\": 0,\n+    \"public_probe_v1\": 0,\n+    \"type_value_export_v1\": 0,\n+    \"two_prior_implementation_failures_preserved\": true,\n+    \"standard_axioms_each\": [\n+      \"propext\",\n+      \"Classical.choice\",\n+      \"Quot.sound\"\n+    ],\n+    \"three_individual_native_fences_safe_verify\": true,\n+    \"whole_loop_native_claim\": false\n+  },\n+  \"actual_VALUE_occurrences\": {\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlineBregman.quadratic_geometry\": [\n+      \"hasStrictFDerivAt_norm_sq\"\n+    ],\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.euclidean_variable_regret\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineBregman.quadratic_geometry\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.iterate_eq_of_source_updates\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.source_variable_regret\",\n+      \"StrongConvexOn.strictConvexOn\",\n+      \"strongConvexOn_iff_convex\"\n+    ],\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.euclidean_fixed_regret\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineBregman.quadratic_geometry\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.iterate_eq_of_source_updates\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.source_fixed_regret\",\n+      \"StrongConvexOn.strictConvexOn\",\n+      \"strongConvexOn_iff_convex\"\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"VALUE_boundary\": \"Whole declaration constants only; occurrence not necessity, branch-specific attribution or full transitive graph. Both endpoints visibly return actual run conjunct and bound.\",\n+  \"packaging_failure\": \"Manifest-v1 false empty selfhash preserved; corrected v2 excludes manifest selfreference and all55 artifact hashes verify. Packaging correction is not mathematical failure.\",\n+  \"remaining\": [\n+    \"Independent canary contracts and separately authorized BODY\",\n+    \"Shared root/Tests/full harness and publication/delivery gates\",\n+    \"No Chapter2/prescient-container/Chapter15/B4/Goal acceptance from this core review\"\n+  ],\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"BanditRLProof\\\\OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"9b755a12d540c1039b068e4b97af90ac483a58fd1a8b40af9c806264f95d42b8\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\formalizer-core-v1\\\\manifest-v2.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"e2372c790fdad6856746381fec27a5acc688e63118503d5ba9a20a404e7901a2\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\formalizer-core-v1\\\\capture-v1.py\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"642f3128f51e14b917ee29abde203051a80cb84bedc186a18c9c0c32bcd07606\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\formalizer-core-v1\\\\capture-v2.py\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"070637efb55c8414d3544c6a7281b235695c91cec2266c1215aa62454a3edc70\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-presc