R]\",\n+        \"/source_proof_edges[to=SPEC-FIX]\",\n+        \"/nodes[id=SPEC-VAR]\",\n+        \"/nodes[id=SPEC-FIX]\"\n+      ],\n+      \"finding\": \"Frozen specialized headers conclude actual Option-iterate equality AND regret inequality. Current AND parents quadratic geometry plus generic regret theorem cover the bound but do not explicitly cover equality of the canonical chosen trajectory to the arbitrary supplied attained-minimizer sequence.\",\n+      \"required_repair\": \"Add a labeled specialization/algorithm-interface obligation for quadratic objective equality, uniqueness/identification of feasible attained minimizers under the frozen support/strict-convexity setting, and finite induction identifying the actual Option run. Bind SRC-ALG15.8, H-ATTAINED, hinit and quadratic geometry; include this as mandatory AND dependency of both full specialized targets. Do not assert the obligation proved or inspect implementation to populate it. No unconditional minimizer existence/total selector claim.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"reviewer\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium; runtime not attested\",\n+  \"reviewed_topology_sha256\": \"b2e51a9780ed1ae8504cdc85cdff832fc748cb0cab2d48c120e67b36979e0ea0\",\n+  \"scope\": \"Source-only topology versus exact frozen three headers/context; no candidate implementation, proof BODY or candidate snapshots read. No build/source mutation.\",\n+  \"original_source_pixels_personally_reviewed\": [\n+    26,\n+    277,\n+    278\n+  ],\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\source-topology-proposal-v1\\\\topology.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"b2e51a9780ed1ae8504cdc85cdff832fc748cb0cab2d48c120e67b36979e0ea0\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\source-topology-proposal-v1\\\\topology.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"4379732e2f684a592ef9530a610c70271505abb58c8b716d43c6abbc5e252a4f\