,\r\n+  \"missing_highlight_dependencies\": [\r\n+    \"HasGradientAt.fderiv_apply\",\r\n+    \"hasStrictFDerivAt_norm_sq\",\r\n+    \"norm_sub_sq_real\"\r\n+  ]\r\n+}\r"},{"sha":"e69de29bb2d1d6434b8b29ae775ad8c2e48c5391","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/pre-repair-gates-v1/site-preflight-v1/stdout.raw","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpre-repair-gates-v1%2Fsite-preflight-v1%2Fstdout.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpre-repair-gates-v1%2Fsite-preflight-v1%2Fstdout.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpre-repair-gates-v1%2Fsite-preflight-v1%2Fstdout.raw?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6"},{"sha":"2d7e22cfce604d1bee6f7da47eeb0c4aaaa5ddec","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/preceding-unbounded-delivery-v1/PR-body-final-v1.md","status":"added","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changes":11,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2FPR-body-final-v1.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2FPR-body-final-v1.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2FPR-body-final-v1.md?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+Prove that the explicit affine construction in Orabona v10 Theorem 5.4 also drives actual variable-step OGD on the full Euclidean space. Preserve the exact horizon threshold, half-phi lower bound, zero initialization/comparator and source schedule; construct globally convex, 1-Lipschitz, differentiable losses.\n+\n+Two complete public canaries check the actual scalar two-round trajectory (explicitly below the source threshold) and a 64-round two-dimensional witness with the printed bound, at least 256/15 and strictly more than 17. Shared Book integration preserves all 11,100 previous canonical nodes and adds one producer node.\n+\n+Separate source reconciliation accepts exactly three frozen target rows within one unbounded-variable-OGD container. Seven Chapter 2 forward containers, six future mathematical claims and B1-B7 repairs remain open. Chapter 2 stays partial with a null complete proof denominator; the Chapters 1-16 Goal remains active. Loss families may depend on T; no single infinite stream or all-schedules result is claimed.\n+\n+Validation at source/metadata commit `609da50f3f5a41dca9ff2ab6d6d0cf8559d89487`: combined Lean root (9,122 jobs), Tests (9,303 jobs), full harness (472 tests, 7 skipped), public canaries, standard-axiom audit, contributor check, site build/check, registry preservation and three independently viewed original local screenshots. Actual failed site-status validation and its one-field repair are retained. Individual native fences ran; the native whole-loop did not.\n+\n+Evidence/delivery commit: `8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59`. Acceptance: `runs/online-ch2-unbounded-ogd-20261011/accepted-current-source-target-package-v1.json` SHA256 `55229d09bb8ef9e1a7ba16245fdd423c1c5870a576413978806dee1dc378efc3`; independent post-adoption FINAL SHA256 `98148c5a2b582ec8a2d7a5a1d6c925171bfaea6e068c67686e3e13a54ff8c059`. Selected 1,309 source/input paths and RAW hashes remain identical after the evidence-only commit.\n+\n+Stacked on `codex/research-online-ch2-target-freeze` at `f86aaded30581da02eba1f0a8691f990cf9ed4f3` (draft PR #219). Main independently advanced to `fea256b1c03b14b79c6c84a965e8ac2b5a738f64`; integration with latest main remains a later gate. This package is unmerged and unpublished; no live-site claim."},{"sha":"96946c0f3b1179c609b9f30cc29b9592e4e6e13b","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/preceding-unbounded-delivery-v1/actual-PR220-delivery-verification-v2.json","status":"added","additions":2011,"deletions":0,"changes":2011,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Factual-PR220-delivery-verification-v2.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Factual-PR220-delivery-verification-v2.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Factual-PR220-delivery-verification-v2.json?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,2011 @@\n+{\n+  \"start_utc\": \"2026-10-11T06:35:52.374189+00:00\",\n+  \"end_utc\": \"2026-10-11T06:36:04.889110+00:00\",\n+  \"PR_url\": \"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/220\",\n+  \"state\": \"open\",\n+  \"draft\": true,\n+  \"remote_HEAD\": \"8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59\",\n+  \"local_HEAD\": \"8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59\",\n+  \"PR_HEAD\": \"8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59\",\n+  \"PR_base_SHA\": \"f86aaded30581da02eba1f0a8691f990cf9ed4f3\",\n+  \"body_exact_equal\": true,\n+  \"body_sha256\": \"54d17386e1e3836acfbdcf4121647db435ed7a0a37242fb3c822616f167924e7\",\n+  \"all_changed_files\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \".gitattributes\",\n+      